Package: totaljs-chrome-source
Version: 1.0.0-1
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Total.js <repository@totaljs.com>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Depends: ca-certificates
Homepage: https://www.google.com/linuxrepositories/
Description: The repository of Google for Chrome, for the Total.js Developer Distros
 The signing key and the source of apt of the repository of Google Chrome (dl.google.com), where the
 package google-chrome-stable comes from. Chrome is not in Ubuntu and is not copied into the repository
 of Total.js: it is downloaded from Google, and updated by apt. The key is the official one of Google
 (fingerprint EB4C 1BFD 4F04 2F6D DDCC EC91 7721 F63B D38B 4796).
